* Channel\nlayer
** One type list
*** 23 values in channels.h
*** kinds and lifecycle stages\nshare a namespace
*** dispatch key for the\nevent loop
*** LARVAL, DYNAMIC,\nZOMBIE, ABANDONED
** Wire type strings
*** RFC 4254: session,\ndirect-tcpip,\nforwarded-tcpip, x11
*** OpenSSH: streamlocal,\nauth-agent, tun
*** allocated in ssh.c, mux.c,\nserverloop.c, channels.c
*** same struct Channel\neverywhere
** Flow control
*** credit window per channel
*** 32 KiB packet,\n2 MiB session window
*** X11 window is 4 packets
*** CHAN_INPUT_MAX 16 MiB
** Half-close
*** istate and ostate
*** four states each
*** WAIT_DRAIN flushes\nbefore EOF
*** CLOSE only when\nboth halves closed
*** nchan.c, nchan.ms
